# Loaded automatically by `vite build` (production mode) — this is the ONE
# place to point the deployed frontend at the deployed backend. Committed
# (not gitignored) on purpose: it has no secrets, only a public API URL, and
# every deploy should build from the same value instead of each developer
# guessing it locally.
#
# Replace the placeholder below with your real deployed backend URL once
# it exists, then every future `vite build` picks it up automatically — no
# code changes, no hunting through the app for a hardcoded URL.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://REPLACE-WITH-YOUR-DEPLOYED-BACKEND-DOMAIN/api/v1
